{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nPlots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement [[cite:obs-e6c01bb303d89ccb8284834bc8355f1de52beafa \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]].\n\nEach plot is forty square metres in size [[cite:obs-e6c01bb303d89ccb8284834bc8355f1de52beafa \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]].\n\nEach plot is one standard unit of allocation in the agreement [[cite:obs-e6c01bb303d89ccb8284834bc8355f1de52beafa \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"450fb9f71e69095252e40d039100ced30e34ee55f69f0b32c9f0b614a6c0ad18","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the plot size as 'forty square metres' with citation from the same source, to meet the requirement of stating the allocation rule and plot size with exact source spans."}